Package: marlinspike-agent
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), openssl, tshark
Maintainer: MarlinSpike Project <noreply@localhost>
Description: Remote sensor agent for MarlinSpike fleet management
 Enrolls with a central MarlinSpike fleet gateway over TLS and maintains
 an authenticated heartbeat connection. Relays live-capture control to a
 local capd sidecar, runs the bundled MarlinSpike analysis engine locally
 on each rotated capture, and ships the resulting report back to the
 central console — the raw PCAP never leaves this host. The agent's own
 transport layer has zero third-party Python dependencies (stdlib
 ssl/asyncio only); the bundled engine is plain Python, no extra pip
 packages needed beyond what's on the base system.
